OL,3,GNEWSARecord-breaker rewarded with
OL,4,Awhisky from the King
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Royal Marine said he has been
OL,7,Fblown away by everyone's reaction after
OL,8,Fcompleting a record-breaking challenge
OL,9,Frowing solo across the Pacific and
OL,10,FIndian Ocean.
OL,12,FDave "Dinger" Bell set off from the
OL,13,Fwest coast of Peru on 9 November last
OL,14,Fyear and only stepped foot on land
OL,15,Fagain this month.
OL,17,FThe veteran said he spent the last 11
OL,18,Fmonths cruising with "man-eating"
OL,19,Fsharks and dolphins, waiting out storms
OL,20,Fand dodging cyclones.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
